rse i'll go over in  another video but i would love to hear  your best theories on why you think  namor is going to be attacking wakanda  now as far as when to expect the actual  teaser trailer to release all eyes are  looking towards this weekend at san  diego comic con hall h where marvel  studios typically reveals anything major  that is up and coming and of course not  to mention we are less than four months  away from wakanda forever hitting  theaters that's about the time frame  where marvel studios typically likes to  release teaser trailers and of course  wakanda forever is the next  up-and-coming movie from marvel studios  so if there is any type of trailer  that's going to be released it should be  for wakanda forever some people are  thinking we could get footage but  typically marvel and disney would show  the trailer first before we got any type  of footage at least that is released  publicly that's what they did for star  wars celebration with the andor trailer  they showed it but they also released it  online and most of us are assuming that  this is pretty much what's going to  happen at sdcc and if it doesn't happen  sdcc d23 is right around the corner as  well either way it should be very very  soon so let me know your best  predictions for the trailer in the  comments down below don't forget to give  the video a like and subscribe so you  can stay up to date on all things marvel  and mcu for live updates you can follow  me on twitter and instagram and as  always thank you all so much for  watching woof

